{"duration_api_ms":172474,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3b815a70-552b-4fde-88b8-1ef3f2958e04","total_cost_usd":0.23248,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15659,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":16984,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":11294},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15659,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":16984,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15659},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":16984,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15659,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.23248,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":11294,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is one curve at the mass-fraction/geometry corner: D~3.38 m, bluntness 1.25, cone 70 deg, with only FPA varying. It runs from FPA -1.5 (q 240.5 kW/m2, T 420.8 K) to FPA -3.59 (q 290.7 kW/m2, T 393.2 K). FPA -3.59 is capped by max_g (margin 0.0012). D is capped near 3.388 m by heatshield mass fraction (margin +0.0046 at 3.38, +0.0017 at 3.385, -0.0013 at 3.39). Every b=1.27-1.28 point at 70 deg failed geometry. The failure lengths (-0.202 mm at 1.27, -4.419 mm at 1.28) fit a D-independent rule b <= 0.1 + 0.4/cos(theta), i.e. b <= 1.2695 at 70 deg. This is my fit to the data, not a documented formula. So the corner is already tight; the only remaining gains are small: b pushed to about 1.265 and D to about 3.385-3.387, plus denser FPA coverage of the front.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-610c90e81316 ... C-a985e3df7a53: D 3.38, b 1.25, theta 70; q rises 240.5k->290.7k while T falls 420.8->393.2 K as FPA goes -1.5->-3.59. Max_g margin is 0.0012 at -3.59.\",\"Mass fraction margin is 0.004613 for every FPA at D=3.38 (so it is independent of FPA), 0.001666 at D=3.385 (C-033d71e70fc9), and -0.001285 at D=3.39 (C-02b4b3f7ed6c). It scales roughly as D^2.\",\"Geometry failures C-7f535e7c4fc3, C-d419fac5d283, C-9a6d36a21c8a (b=1.27) and C-80fe5cc98264, C-6fd0d116b298, C-37a969e6dce6 (b=1.28), all at theta=70. Fitted limit is b<=~1.2695, so b=1.265 should be buildable and 1.25 is known good.\",\"C-0506f1b13e81 (D 3.34, b 1.1, theta 68, FPA -3.55) has q 302k versus ~289k at the corner, consistent with q ~ 1/sqrt(b*D); it shows that a larger nose radius lowers q.\",\"g depends almost only on FPA (~1.55 g per degree near -3.59). Limit is 12.0, so FPA more negative than about -3.599 fails.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Stagnation heat flux scales roughly as sqrt(rho/Rn)*V^3, with Rn = b*D on this evidence. Bond-line temperature follows integrated heat load. A larger Rn and larger D lower q and T. D is capped by heatshield mass fraction (mass ~ D^2) and b by the nose/shoulder overlap rule at theta=70. Steeper FPA shortens the pulse and lowers T but raises q and g, and g caps FPA at about -3.59. So the front shifts down only slightly with b 1.25->1.265 (q about -0.6%, T about -0.2 K) and D up to about 3.387. The rest of the value is filling gaps along the FPA curve. I include two small off-corner probes (theta 69 and 67) to check the cone-angle sensitivity.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The b-limit rule is fitted from two failure magnitudes. The 0.2 mm mismatch at b=1.27 means b=1.265 leaves only ~2 mm of margin. Mass-fraction sensitivity to b is extrapolated (I estimated ~-0.05% area per +0.015 in b), so D=3.387 may slightly violate it. The g dependence on b and D is estimated only from C-0506f1b13e81. The expected gains are small (order 1e-3 in normalised HV). Predicted q and T are interpolated from the FPA sweep with small assumed offsets.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-610c90e81316\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow end of the front with b raised to 1.265 (within the geometry limit) and D=3.385 (known feasible on mass fraction).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":420.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether higher b and D shifts the whole front down and confirms b=1.265 is buildable.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-01990c929694\",\"rationale\":\"Front fill at FPA -1.6 with the b/D shift.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":418.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the shallow end of the shifted front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-01990c929694\",\"rationale\":\"Front fill at FPA -1.7, where there is a gap between -1.6 and -1.85.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":242770,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-5c61fb861f20\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -1.85.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.85},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.85,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the front and confirms the b/D benefit is consistent across FPA.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6d99358fc11d\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -1.95.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.95},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":248230,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0df08c41f528\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -2.15.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":252850,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0df08c41f528\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -2.3, where there is a gap between -2.15 and -2.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256420,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":408.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2749e4185a85\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":261230,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-7a42d9b2504a\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266150,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-18e0e39fa642\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -2.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-71dbb7df9fb4\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -3.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":276100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f28cc7d64819\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -3.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279240,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-fe378e1d3bfd\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -3.4; g there is about 11.7, so it has margin.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":283000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill near the g-limited end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0cc74a44c5f0\",\"rationale\":\"Shifted-front point at FPA -3.5; g is about 11.87 (limit 12).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":286100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front fill near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a985e3df7a53\",\"rationale\":\"Near the g limit (about 11.97) with the b/D shift.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.05,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the steep, low-T end of the front improves with b=1.265 while staying inside the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-033d71e70fc9\",\"rationale\":\"Slightly larger D of 3.387 at the g-limited end. The mass-fraction margin should be about +0.001.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.387,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.585},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the mass-fraction boundary with b=1.265; a pass lets D be pushed further.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-610c90e81316\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow end with D=3.387 to test mass-fraction sensitivity to b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.387,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238450,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":420.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the D=3.387 feasibility at a different FPA. Mass fraction is independent of FPA, so this also duplicates the mass-fraction test cheaply.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2749e4185a85\",\"rationale\":\"Mid-front point with D=3.387 for D-sensitivity of q and T.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.387,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":261100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.35,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Quantifies the small D effect at mid FPA.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a985e3df7a53\",\"rationale\":\"Same as the steepest corner design but with b=1.265 and D=3.385, at FPA -3.59 (g about 11.988).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.265,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.59},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.97,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the lowest-T end of the front with the shifted geometry; g margin is only about 0.001.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0506f1b13e81\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-angle probe at theta 69, b 1.21 (limit about 1.216), D 3.37, FPA -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.37,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.21,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":280700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks whether theta<70 changes Cd, q or mass fraction enough to beat the corner. It also tests my b-limit rule at another angle.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-0506f1b13e81\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-angle probe at theta 67, b 1.1 (limit about 1.124), D 3.36, FPA -3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.36,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.1,\"cone_half_angle_deg\":67.0,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":302900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gives a second point on the theta sensitivity of q, T and mass fraction; likely dominated but informative for later rounds.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":128659,"type":"result","duration_ms":172504,"uuid":"39a354fc-e73d-4229-ba6b-52ea464766fb","ttft_stream_ms":1167,"time_to_request_ms":28,"first_content_frame_ms":1167,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
